{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_tactics_quick_bucket_current_flow_quick_bucket_flow", "label": "Quick bucket \u5f53\u524d\u4efb\u52a1\u4e0e\u63a7\u5236\u6d41\u7a0b (2026-10-07 \u6838\u5bf9)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/Tactics/QUICK_BUCKET_CURRENT_FLOW.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_tactics_quick_bucket_current_flow_quick_drop_profile_bucket", "label": "quick_drop_profile=bucket \u9ed8\u8ba4\u7b56\u7565 (\u53ef\u5207 blue \u57fa\u7ebf)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Tactics/QUICK_BUCKET_CURRENT_FLOW.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u4e24\u5206\u652f\u771f\u673a quick \u4e0e Optimization \u4eff\u771f\u9ed8\u8ba4 bucket\uff1bquick_drop_profile:=blue \u5207\u56de\u84dd\u76d8\u57fa\u7ebf\uff1b\u901a\u7528\u8282\u70b9\u4ee3\u7801 profile \u9ed8\u8ba4\u503c\u4ecd\u4e3a blue\u3002"}, {"id": "docs_tactics_quick_bucket_current_flow_cylinder_visual_release", "label": "cylinder_visual \u6295\u653e\u8bb8\u53ef\u673a\u5236 (1s \u5185 3 \u5e27 \u22648px + \u5239\u8f66 0.30s + \u65b0\u5e27)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/Tactics/QUICK_BUCKET_CURRENT_FLOW.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_tactics_quick_bucket_current_flow_cylinder_timeout_release", "label": "cylinder_timeout 16s \u4fdd\u5e95\u6295\u653e\u673a\u5236", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/Tactics/QUICK_BUCKET_CURRENT_FLOW.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u6700\u7ec8\u9ad8\u5ea6 16 \u79d2\u672a\u5bf9\u5fc3\u8fbe\u6807\u5219\u5239\u8f66\u540e\u4ecd\u6295\u653e\uff0c\u907f\u514d\u9ad8\u7a7a\u65e0\u9650\u7b49\u5f85\uff1b\u6b64\u8def\u5f84\u53ef\u4ee5\u6ca1\u6709\u5f53\u524d\u5706\u7b52/\u84dd\u76d8\u89c2\u6d4b\uff0